674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kboMGGujCPEQ7kNvwFM5vSk&_nc_oc=Ado1ycF1xxa5xvJvwYS9IgLEOaEZ9Gh-J-MGWsQZ7w6UVuAAgPFDrd7al2Ok_hXpOyg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0qgRgZlCSKOI4grpa7pb0pVlCW6wGg9wJB-lUMdqRF5w&oe=69D51559"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=at_b-zVFtnwQ7kNvwFY67Oy&_nc_oc=Adp2CKDqj2VpIAp7kz92CDsCJdi95fqb0L2m2sDFoNONiBqb2MzYZzWJtGt4tMuLKgw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0FKNbtKw62F9CEt8oJIHko8xojyLcUR_BYAZUKzQ_LHg&oe=69D4E5D6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nfplwTljPCcQ7kNvwGrm-Jy&_nc_oc=AdrrHlPsPNcDQ6zq39wHXnX0_la1Ok9va5WBwTcjmwK6U2GZYPOZ6EgsKDdAbaxkNCc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0E8sqRkxqo9G3tLvc1vjfVdd7RSdrpAlDoffqagoG7iA&oe=69D51A31"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip